# Templates
Data publishing templates for standardizing and publishing biological survey and monitoring data to GBIF

This directory contains templates for publishing biological survey and monitoring data to using the Darwin Core data standard. Eventually there will be subdirectories to templates for both data models: Darwin Core Archives (DwC-A) and Darwin Core Data Packages (DwC-DP). Each directory will denote the data model to which they apply with 'DwC-A_' or 'DwC-DP_' at the start of the directory name. Only DwC-A templates are available currently; DwC-DP templates will be added when available.

## Directories
* DwC-A_Full_Template: Darwin Core Archives. Full data publishing model following Darwin Core Event core with Humboldt extension for biological survey data. 
* DwC-A_Min-Rec-Model_Template: Darwin Core Archives. Minimum recommended data publishing model following Darwin Core Event core with Humboldt extension for biological survey data. 

Each directory contains:
* A single .xlsx file containing a ReadMe and each table in the template.
* A series of .csv files, one for each template table and the ReadMe file.
